## Starter Files

The files under `internal/starter/files/` are the first content that the software writes into a new records repository. These terms do not apply to those files, to the copies of them that the software writes, or to changes made to those copies. Instead, you may use them under the MIT No Attribution license, whose text is in `internal/starter/LICENSE`.

